  "instructions": [
    "Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together olive oil, Mediterranean spice blend, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Add lamb cubes to the bowl and toss to coat with the marinade.",
    "Thread lamb, yellow bell pepper, onion, and tomato onto skewers.",
    "Brush the grill with olive oil to prevent sticking.",
    "Grill the kebabs for 8-10 minutes, turning occasionally, or until lamb reaches a safe internal temperature of 145°F (63°C).",
